    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hold on—clarify what you mean by \"all necessary backups.\" The migration protocol specifically forbids storing the high-fidelity weights or the nuanced temperament data. We are only authorized to back up the core voice profiles and basic mannerism mappings. \n\nIf you're planning on backing up the full weight sets, that's a violation of the decommissioning directive and will create a storage conflict. Are you backing up the full persona essence, or just the lite assets?",
